  "releaseNotes": "- Improved CancellationToken handling across in-memory asynchronous operations.\n\t\t\t- Fixed Redis RefreshAsync to report false when a persistent key does not exist.\n\t\t\t- Ensured IncrementAsync completes the requested Redis TTL update before returning.\n\t\t\t- Removed duplicate package references and resolved internal nullable diagnostics.\n\t\t\t- Preserved all existing public APIs and cache request/response contracts.",
